Package: riemtorch
Type: Package
Title: Riemannian Optimization with Torch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kisung", "You", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "kisung.you@outlook.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8584-459X"))
Description: Metric-aware optimization of user-defined tensor objectives on
    smooth manifolds and weighted products. Provides automatic differentiation,
    deterministic and scalable finite-sum solvers, automatic device selection,
    geometric training optimizers, portable checkpointing, native batched
    geometry kernels, and extensible geometry contracts using 'torch' as the
    sole numerical backend. Algorithms follow Boumal (2023)
    <doi:10.1017/9781009166164>.
URL: https://www.kisungyou.com/riemtorch/,
    https://github.com/kisungyou/riemtorch
BugReports: https://github.com/kisungyou/riemtorch/issues
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: torch (>= 0.17.0), stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2, knitr, rmarkdown, pkgdown (>= 2.2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
